<title>USA: Idan Software names Meir Moshe CFO.</title>
<headline>Idan Software names Meir Moshe CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Idan Software Industries ISI Ltd said Tuesday it has named Meir Moshe chief financial officer and vice president - finance.</p>
<p>The company said Moshe replaces Gad Goldstein, who resigned May 28.</p>
<p>The company also said shareholders have approved a one-for-15 reverse stock split. Shareholders will be paid cash for fractional shares, it said.</p>
<p>The reverse split became effective Tuesday, it said.</p>
